1e:["$","section","Standard Deduction (标准扣除额)-4",{"className":"rounded-2xl border-l-[6px] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm shadow-brand-pink/10 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1","style":{"backgroundColor":"#94A98715","borderColor":"#94A987"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-brand-ink flex items-center gap-2 mb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#94A987"},"className":"font-bold","children":"▸"}]," ","Standard Deduction (标准扣除额)"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-ink/75","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"1040 默认给每个居民（Resident ）约 $15,000  的免税额度（2025/2026 财年数据）。"}],["$","p","1",{"children":"但问题是OPT多数情况下并不是Resident。而Non-resident 绝大多数情况下没有标准扣除额。"}],["$","p","2",{"children":"如果你拿 W-2 填了 1040，IRS 会以为你多赚了 $15,000 的免税额，多退你几千刀。但这钱不是你该拿的，IRS 的审计系统（尤其是针对 F-1 转换 H1B 时）很容易查出这种身份不匹配。"}]]}]]}]
1f:["$","section","到底怎么解读你收到的 W-2？-5",{"className":"rounded-2xl border-l-[6px] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm shadow-brand-pink/10 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1","style":{"backgroundColor":"#D9939315","borderColor":"#D99393"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-brand-ink flex items-center gap-2 mb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#D99393"},"className":"font-bold","children":"▸"}]," ","到底怎么解读你收到的 W-2？"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-ink/75","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"W-2 表格代表的是\"工资收入 (Wages)\"。"}],["$","p","1",{"children":"只要你在美国公司做正式员工（Employee），公司通过薪酬系统（Payroll）给你发工资，他们法律上必须给你发 W-2。"}],["$","p","2",{"children":"但W-2 并不代表你的身份是 Resident 还是 Non-Resident，它只代表你的收入性质。"}]]}]]}]
20:["$","section","NRA 也可能会收到 1042-S-6",{"className":"rounded-2xl border-l-[6px] p-6 sm:p-8 shadow-sm shadow-brand-pink/10 transition-transform hover:translate-x-1","style":{"backgroundColor":"#D9C7B815","borderColor":"#D9C7B8"},"children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-lg font-bold text-brand-ink flex items-center gap-2 mb-4","children":[["$","span",null,{"style":{"color":"#D9C7B8"},"className":"font-bold","children":"▸"}]," ","NRA 也可能会收到 1042-S"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-ink/75","children":[["$","p","0",{"children":"这通常发生在以下两种情况："}],["$","ul","1",{"className":"space-y-3 list-disc pl-6","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"pl-2 leading-relaxed","children":"奖学金/助学金 (Scholarships/Fellowships)：如果你在学校拿了免除学费以外的现金补助。"}],["$","li","1",{"className":"pl-2 leading-relaxed","children":"提前申请了税收协定 (Treaty)：如果你在入职时给公司填了 Form 8233，要求公司直接不扣那 $5,000 的税，那么公司会将这 $5,000 呈现在 1042-S 表格上，而剩下的工资放在 W-2 上。"}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"bg-amber-50/60 border-l-4 border-amber-300 p-4 rounded-r-lg shadow-sm","children":["$","p",null,{"className":"text-brand-ink/85 font-medium","children":"BUT：大多数 OPT 公司的 HR 并不专业，他们通常不会帮你处理 8233。所以，他们会把你的所有收入都写在 W-2 上。"}]}]]}]]}]
